      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.97,
      "end_seconds": 236.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.25,
      "end_seconds": 257.44,
      "duration_seconds": 10.19,
      "text": "The creases in your palms and your scars are darker than they should be and and your blood pressure drops when you stand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.2,
      "end_seconds": 264.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "alright, thank you, you can get dressed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.19,
      "end_seconds": 307.1,
      "duration_seconds": 28.91,
      "text": "so, based on the history and the examination, this is probably possible adrenal insufficiency i'd like to arrange a short synacthen test for possible adrenal insufficiency i'm sending you for blood tests because of possible adrenal insufficiency drink fluids and eat salty foods until the results, and come in if you vomit i'd like you to see the endocrine clinic as well, and I'll write the referral"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.82,
      "end_seconds": 324.95,
      "duration_seconds": 17.13,
      "text": "Please don't wait if the symptoms get worse. That's when to be seen urgently. I'll want another look after the results. Okay, can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 326.56,
      "end_seconds": 331.91,
      "duration_seconds": 5.35,
      "text": "so, I come back after the results. Is that right?"
